{"version":1,"content":"<p>Hardware Unboxed分析十個國家的顯卡零售市場後表示，顯卡價格已經連續第三個月上漲。按其統計口徑，10月平均價格環比再漲10%，計入GeForce RTX 5090後為11%；結合8月上漲15%和9月上漲7%，三個月累計漲幅約35%。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1584452.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T09:03:57.003634+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":128,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T08:53:10+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T08:58:54.894062+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T08:58:54.894062+00:00","content_hash":"91439be32f65655bf7cb88f88f9d11eba4b40e1e3a5d11afbc0f6f3f3ddb0cb6","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}